   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Insisting",
     "texto": [
      "To insist that something is so, and that the other person does not believe you, use **-다니까(요)**: 가다 → **간다니까요** (Yes, I'm going, I said!), 되다 → **된다니까요** (I'm telling you it does work!). With nouns, **-(이)라니까요**: 진짜**라니까요** = I'm telling you it really is!",
      "이거 정말 맛있**다니까요** = I'm telling you this is really delicious!"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Not necessarily",
     "texto": [
      "**N(이)라고 해서 다 A/V-(으)ㄴ/는 것은 아니다** means «the fact of being N does not imply that…» or «not all N…». 학생**이라고 해서 다 공부를 잘하는 것은 아니에요** = not all students study well.",
      "The second part expresses what cannot be taken for granted; it does not automatically state the opposite."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
